{"id": "ST_Quests|MQCTS_Desc", "source_en": "You've awoken from your coffin at the Order's hall, the Sanctus Clypeus. Your first task is to speak with the Knight Commander Gallant Alexander.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "لقد استيقظت من تابوتك في مقر الجماعة، سانكتوس كليبيوس. مهمتك الأولى هي التحدث مع قائد الفرسان قالانت ألكسندر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 11}}
{"id": "ST_Quests|MQP_Desc", "source_en": "You've been sent to the city of Gildenarch in response to an invasion by unknown forces. Rendezvous with your captain and receive your first orders.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "تم إرسالك إلى مدينة قيلدنارك استجابةً لغزو قامت به قوى مجهولة. التقِ بقائدك لتلقي أوامرك الأولى.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 11}}
{"id": "ST_Quests|SQTOV_Desc", "source_en": "You've found a stange obsidian totem in the shape of a woman. Gajov knows its origin and needs your help repairing the Totem.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "لقد وجدتَ تمثالاً غريباً من الأوبسيديان على شكل امرأة. يعرف قاجوف أصله ويحتاج إلى مساعدتك في إصلاح التمثال.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 11}}
